OL,5,G0200 Trucking Heavy
OL,6,     FIn Wales, haulier Ian gears
OL,7,     Fhimself up for a major
OL,8,     Fcross-country mega-move that
OL,9,     Frequires a police escort. And in
OL,10,     FHull, mega mover Steve is in
OL,11,     Fcharge of shifting a 38-tonne
OL,12,     Fscreener.
OL,13,G0300 Trucking Heavy
OL,14,     FA trio of truckers are moving a
OL,15,     F63-tonne train track tamping
OL,16,     Fmachine from a siding on the
OL,17,     Foutskirts of Glasgow to a rail
OL,18,     Fyard in Stranraer.
